    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d832">

                <pb facs="0983" n="903" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg903"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Calderon to
                            Acting Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peruvian Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Gloucester,
                                Mass.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1902-09-04"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September 4,
                    1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>While deeply deploring the accident met with by His Excellency President
                    Roosevelt, I beg you to convey to him the hearty congratulations of the
                    President and the people of Peru, as well as my own, for his felicitious
                    escape.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Manuel Alvarez
                    Calderon.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
